// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Back Alley Brawler 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3365661715" "Back Alley Brawler"
// ProfessionString :
"P876045537" "Freedom Phalanx"
// DescriptionString :
"P319516936" "The Brawler was the son of a gang enforcer. He joined the Paragon City police force to try and make a difference. When he realized that was not getting the job done he adopted the name and costume of a hero. He fought in the streets and alleys, of the city, all through the late 70's and the 80's. He briefly went into retirement after that, but came back out to help with the Rikti war. Now he coordinates the efforts of heroes in King's Row."
// WrongAllianceString :
"P2954372161" "I mistrust your motives, {HeroName}, and mistrust you. Leave me be."
// HelloString :
"P3078984749" "What's up, youngster?"
// HelloString :
"P2778151463" "You look like you need some help."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3154829561" "You are barking up the wrong tree, youngster."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2364816028" "Little Ms. Liberty says you got the stuff, {HeroName}. You wouldn't want to prove her worng, now would you?"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1438474873" "Not bad, not bad at all."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3263880721" "Looks like Ms. Liberty, was right about you after all."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1042180384" "Move on, youngster."
// IntroString :
"P3025612172" "The Back Alley Brawler is one of the cities oldest surviving heroes. He won't steer you wrong."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P1602907074" "Choose Back Alley Brawler"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2674380308" "The Brawler is a no nonsense kind of guy."
// LocationString :
"P2848267662" "Galaxy City"
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P556112955" "Go find Positron, Youngster."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P3343443605" "IntroduceTwoContacts"
// StoreTitleString :
"P268763520" "StoreTitleString"
// StoreYouBoughtXXXString :
"P1147715973" "StoreYouBoughtXXXString"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


