// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Citadel 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1542252812" "Citadel"
// ProfessionString :
// DescriptionString :
"P1466759021" "Fresh from an upgrade at DATA's Atlas Park offices, Paragon City's famous android hero has decided to change his name in honor of his new programming. With his enhanced defense systems and sensors, he will henceforth be known as Citadel. The very first android hero, Citadel took heavy damage in the initial Rikti onslaught, and was almost completely destroyed. Scientists at DATA created a second version of Citadel using the old model's original memory core and the remnants of a power suit, once worn by the hero Horatio. Despite his recently augmented data processing, Citadel still does not fully understand human ways. Nevertheless, he is a valiant defender of Paragon City."
// TaskForceInvite :
"P3161126503" "Greetings. I have a very difficult task for you. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need a group of heroes to investigate the Council.</A> Manticore has heard some disturbing rumors about them lately.<br><br>My sensors indicate increased Council activity in Independence Port. Please begin there and return with any data you find."
// PlayerLevelTooLow :
"P3424957415" "This task is too dangerous for you. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 6 members on your team, all of them at least Level 25. If they are over Level 30, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 30 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// PlayerLevelTooHigh :
"P2917428063" "You can put your great skills to better use elsewhere. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 6 members on your team, all of them at least Level 25. If they are over Level 30, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 30 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// NeedLargeTeam :
"P2140416621" "To form a task force, you need six or more heroes in your group. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 6 members on your team, all of them at least Level 25. If they are over Level 30, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 30 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// NeedTeamLeader :
"P390856509" "Sorry, but I need to speak with the team leader."
// NeedTeamOnMap :
"P3314444780" "I need everyone in your team present and accounted for."
// BadTeamLevel :
"P374003625" "Some members of your team don't meet the requirements for this job. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 6 members on your team, all of them at least Level 25. If they are over Level 30, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 30 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
