"P1337139117" "I've been hearing a lot about you all lately. Your contacts have put the word on the street that you are all forces to be reckoned with. I'm sure that by banding together, you can really put a dent in the criminal activities here in Paragon City.<br><br>Statesman has instituted a Task Force Program, for groups of heroes looking to do some good. You and your friends can become a task force to fight crime as a cohesive unit."
// PlayerLevelTooLow :
"P4111653648" "I have a job that needs to be done, but I am afraid it's a bit too dangerous for you. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 3 members on your team, all of them at least Level 10. If they are over Level 15, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 15 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// PlayerLevelTooHigh :
"P3681932126" "Sorry, I don't have anything worthy of your skills. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 3 members on your team, all of them at least Level 10. If they are over Level 15, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 15 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// NeedLargeTeam :
