"P3489510796" "I'm glad you're back, {HeroName}. Time is of the essence!<br><br>The Clockwork, Circle of Thorns, and Vahzilok are all moving forward with their plans and it all revolves around the Faultline Dam!<br><br>I need you to form up another team and help resolve this situation once and for all!"
// PlayerLevelTooLow :
"P2677039619" "I have a job that needs to be done, but I am afraid it's a bit too dangerous for you. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 3 members on your team, all of them at least Level 11. If they are over Level 16, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 16 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// PlayerLevelTooHigh :
"P2985781837" "Sorry, I don't have anything worthy of your skills. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 3 members on your team, all of them at least Level 11. If they are over Level 16, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 16 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// NeedLargeTeam :
"P3541760216" "To form a task force, you need three or more heroes in your group. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 3 members on your team, all of them at least Level 11. If they are over Level 16, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 16 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// NeedTeamLeader :
// NeedTeamOnMap :
// BadTeamLevel :
"P2798245496" "Some members of your team don't meet the requirements for this task. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 3 members on your team, all of them at least Level 11. If they are over Level 16, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 16 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
