"P1924717238" "Since you and I are going to be working together, you are going to need a code name. I will refer to you as {TaskForceName} from here on out."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
// BadgeNeededString :
"P2301877203" "The rest of the city is calm. Well, as calm as a city full of super-powered beings can be.<br><br>I could use your hand though with other things around Steel Canyon - as long as you have some backup."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3810778087" "Meeting in person isn't going to work anymore, {TaskForceName}, especially if this is going where I think it is. I've updated my communicator line to give you a direct line to it whenever you need to speak with me."
