"P3744943569" "Sister Psyche"
// ProfessionString :
// DescriptionString :
"P1132883590" "Even in her childhood, it was obvious that Sister Psyche was blessed. The tremendous scope of her mental powers was far beyond that of any hero, past or present. When the Rikti War descended, Sister Psyche knew she had to make her gift count. She did, but at a price. She exhausted her powers so thoroughly that she fell into a coma. A young heroine named Aurora Borealis offered to play host to Sister Psyche's projected mental self. Of course, this situation could not last forever. Now back in her own body, Sister Psyche has dedicated herself to helping to shape the tremendous gifts of the young Aurora. It's a responsibility she takes seriously, as well as a consolation for the loss of her former protoge, Malaise. When the psychic link between the two women was first disrupted, Sister Psyche lost her mental control over Malaise's dual personalities. The old Malaise reasserted himself, and quickly made his departure. His present whereabouts are as yet unknown."
// TaskForceInvite :
"P3843401329" "I have sensed is a great disturbance in the natural order of our world, and the Freakshow are involved. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>The nature of this imbalance is not yet clear to me, but I need you to investigate the Freakshow.</A> Perhaps you can learn something from one of them."
// PlayerLevelTooLow :
"P622493192" "I'm afraid you are not qualified to take on my next task. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 5 members on your team, all of them at least Level 20. If they are over Level 25, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 25 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// PlayerLevelTooHigh :
"P3131966898" "You are far too skilled to concern yourself with my troubles. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 5 members on your team, all of them at least Level 20. If they are over Level 25, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 25 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// NeedLargeTeam :
"P4141299950" "To form a task force, you need five or more heroes in your group. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 5 members on your team, all of them at least Level 20. If they are over Level 25, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 25 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// NeedTeamLeader :
// NeedTeamOnMap :
// BadTeamLevel :
"P2498023328" "Some members of your team don't meet the requirements for this task. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 5 members on your team, all of them at least Level 20. If they are over Level 25, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 25 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
