// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Ms. Liberty 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
// ProfessionString :
"P2951953312" "Leader of the Vindicators"
// DescriptionString :
"P1921201018" "Ms. Liberty is the daughter of the original Miss Liberty from the Golden Age. She has taken up the mantle to fight for freedom, in this specific case to free Paragon City from its infestation of villains. She has heightened strength and endurance as well as the power of the Liberty Belt, which was passed on to her by her grandmother.<br><br>After the deaths of her mother and her grandfather, Statesman, Ms. Liberty has renewed her cause to stop all of Recluse's evil plans in the hopes of one day redeeming him."
// TaskForceInvite :
"P3085758958" "We've been watching developments in the Rogue Isles with growing concern. My Uncle, Lord Recluse will soon complete a mysterious structure called 'The Web' on Grandville Island. We have no idea what this structure is supposed to do, only that Recluse expects it to turn the tide in his personal war against freedom. We need to delay the Web's completion, learn the Web's purpose, and stop Recluse's plans for it. We need a team of heroes could do what needs to be done, and <A HREF={ACCEPT}>put an end to Lord Recluse's mad schemes.</A> If he succeeds, there's going to be no going back for him, {HeroName}."
// TaskForceRewardRequiresText :
"P311247617" "<color red>Warning!</color><br><color deepskyblue>The following characters in this group have recently completed this Task Force, and will not be eligible for the REWARD NAME reward available at the end of the final mission:<color>"
// PlayerLevelTooLow :
"P3306678651" "A bad situation is starting out in the Rogue Isles, and I'll need a team of 8 brave and powerful heroes to handle it. I don't question your bravery, but I can't risk sending out anyone below security level 45. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You must have 8 heroes on your team, all of them at least Level 45, in order to begin this Task Force.</color>"
// PlayerLevelTooHigh :
"P202109835" "This is my 'PlayerLevelTooHigh' text. Since this Task Force runs from level 45-50, it's unlikely you'll see it unless they raise the level cap, or you're digging through the .pigg files.<br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 8 heroes on your team, all of them at least Level 45, in order to begin this Task Force.</color>"
// NeedLargeTeam :
"P459914650" "The situation in the Rogue Isles is about to explode, but if I sent you in there with less than a full team of 8 heroes, all of at least security level 45, I could be sending you to your death. If you feel that you're up to this challenge, get a team together and come talk to me. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 8 heroes on your team, all of them at least Level 45, in order to begin this Task Force.</color>"
// NeedTeamLeader :
"P1776707420" "I appreciate your enthusiasm, but for a task like this I need to keep the lines of communication clear. Let me talk to your team's leader so we can get this operation moving."
// NeedTeamOnMap :
"P1218996829" "I need everyone in your team present in Independence Port before we can begin the Task Force."
// BadTeamLevel :
"P2732954376" "I don't question your bravery, but I'm worried that some members of your team may not be powerful enough to survive this battle. I wouldn't feel right sending anyone with a security level below 45 on this Task Force. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 8 heroes on your team, all of them at least Level 45, in order to begin this Task Force.</color>"
// TaskForceName :
"P2435496993" "Task Force Champion"
// TaskForceName :
"P4156543290" "Task Force Freedom"
// TaskForceName :
"P1174824401" "Task Force Guardian"
// TaskForceName :
"P1451074116" "Task Force Infinity"
// TaskForceName :
"P3725659902" "Task Force Justice"
// TaskForceName :
"P1426892537" "Task Force Liberty"
// TaskForceName :
"P1805580680" "Task Force Pinnacle"
