"P3372674839" "Task Force Triumph"
// TaskForceName :
"P2287277437" "Task Force Victory"
// TaskForceName :
"P3878584226" "Task Force Virtue"
// HelloString :
"P4085983715" "Greetings, {TaskForceName}!"
// HelloString :
"P2543267856" "{TaskForceName}, are you ready?"
// HelloString :
"P47815852" "The fate of the world may be on your shoulders, {TaskForceName}!"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2910845808" "I don't think you're ready for this task yet. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 8 heroes on your team, all of them at least Level 45, in order to begin this Task Force.</color>"
// FirstVisitString :
"P3229285190" "Task force code-names came out of the Rikti War. I didn't think they'd become a tradition. Very well. I shall call your team {TaskForceName}. Use it with pride, heroes."
// SOLFirstVisitString :
"P568289853" "I shall call your team {TaskForceName}. Use it with pride, heroes."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P933316395" "Thank you for all that you've done. Now, go out there and be a hero!"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1976150514" "You're doing well so far, {TaskForceName}, but it will only become more difficult from here on."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2400919994" "You've fought bravely, and done great honor to the name {TaskForceName}, but the battle isn't over, and the most difficult part is still to come."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P103209757" "That's peculiar, heroes. This is my text for when you're too high level, and unless the level cap has been raised, you probably shouldn't see it."
