// Name :
"P1028011008" "Woodsman"
// ProfessionString :
// DescriptionString :
"P3985053300" "Tales of the Wild Hunt sweeping over the earth exist far back into the mists of time.  There are those that say anyone unfortunate enough to be in its path will be fallen upon. Others speak a different tale, one that tells of the Hunt bringing to ground only those that perpetrate evil on the land. This latter group is the one closer to the truth. The leader of the Wild Hunt has been called many things by many different peoples. Woden, Herne the Hunter, and Cernunnos among others. This powerful figure now patrols the environs of Paragon City and is known as... the Woodsman.<p>William Prescott was always more comfortable when he was able to leave the confines of Paragon city and enjoy the country. His father was Dr. Samuel Prescott, a fine horseman who rode with Paul Revere on that famous night. On one of Williams's jaunts into the wilderness he came upon a well in the middle of the woods. He approached it just as the last rays of sun were disappearing behind the hills. As William gazed down into the depths a glow appeared at the bottom of the well. He was suffused with a feeling of power and the need to run free through the night. William awakened the next morning with little memory of what had happened to him.  Over the course of several months he slowly realized the change that had come over him. He was filled with the power of the Wild Hunt and driven to combat the dark forces in Paragon City"
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// StoreTitleString :
// StoreYouBoughtXXXString :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

